537
00:28:23.785 --> 00:28:25.453
Iyon ang sinabi mo, hindi ba?

538
00:28:25.537 --> 00:28:28.206
- Ay, Ae-sun!
- Oh.

539
00:28:30.041 --> 00:28:32.127
Ikaw maliit…

540
