592
00:31:40.273 --> 00:31:43.192
Hindi ko masabi kung nagpapakita ka ba o hindi.

593
00:31:43.276 --> 00:31:44.777
Nagpapakitang gilas?

594
00:31:45.278 --> 00:31:47.155
